---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Routine" description="The routines currently helping me focus, learn, and make things.">
  <article class="text-page">
    <header class="page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Current practice</p>
      <h1>Routine</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="page-copy">
      <p>Right now I am keeping the routine simple: protect time for focused work, sharpen my software development fundamentals, move every day, and make more things instead of only thinking about making them.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
